</span><a href=3D"https://huggingface.co/CohereLabs/tiny-aya-global">tiny-a=
ya-global</a><span> (best balance across languages and regions)</span></p><=
/li><li><p><span> </span><a href=3D"https://huggingface.co/CohereLabs/tiny-=
aya-fire">tiny-aya-fire</a><span> (optimized for South Asian languages)</sp=
